@referentiel = http://localhost:8081
@planning = http://localhost:8082
@presences = http://localhost:8083
@notifications = http://localhost:8084
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@registry = http://localhost:8761
@config = http://localhost:8888

# notification-service (8084) : emails envoyes depuis Kafka
# Les emails sont visibles dans Mailpit : http://localhost:8025

### Statut des emails du cours -> SENT
GET {{notifications}}/api/notifications/cours/{{coursId}}

> {%
    client.test("200", () => client.assert(response.status === 200));
    client.test("email SENT", () => client.assert(response.body.some(n => n.status === "SENT")));
%}

### gateway-service (8080) : memes API, routees via Eureka
GET {{gateway}}/api/classes
X-Client-Id: demo-intellij

### Gateway -> planning
GET {{gateway}}/api/cours/{{coursId}}
X-Client-Id: demo-intellij

### Gateway -> presences
GET {{gateway}}/api/appels/cours/{{coursId}}
X-Client-Id: demo-intellij

### Rate limit : cliquer vite ~12 fois sur cette requete -> certaines reponses 429
GET {{gateway}}/api/classes
X-Client-Id: burst-test
